{"slug":"Universal-Script-Dynamic-Fly-(BETA)-225609","_id":"6a8f16774204a2f6947af8ae","title":"Dynamic Fly BETA","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Explanation\n\nDynamic Fly Is A Fly Script With A Modern UI, VehicleSeat Support, Adjustable Speed, Light/Dark Mode And Some Other Stuff.\n\n~\n\nYou Can Change The Fly Value, Speed Value And UIScale Externally If You Want To Adjust Them Or Use Them With Your Own Keybinds / GUI.\n\n~\n\nThe GUI Can Be Dragged Around, Minimized And Expanded, And It Also Has A Topbar Button When Minimized.\n\n~\n\nPC Controls\n\nF ~ Fly / Unfly\nW / A / S / D ~ Move\nQ ~ Down\nE ~ Up\nLeftControl + F ~ Minimize / Expand\n\n~\n\nExtra Description\n\nDefault Toggle: false\nDefault Theme: Light\nDefault Speed: 32 SPS\nVersion: V0.9.8 (Beta)\n\n~\n\nCoded By aabaaii13\nObfuscated By @WildWide & @WildWide1\n\n~\n\nSuper Extra Information: Keyless & Free Forever!","tags":["keyless","fly","vfly","dfly","dynamic"],"script":"--delta executor is recommended!\nloadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aabbaaii13/aabbaaii/refs/heads/main/DynamicFly/DFly.lua'))()","owner":{"_id":"65a1f4a490fcb8835c097696","username":"Aabbaaii13","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/884b09d9546137653394d199386844f50d89116b81dc8190f0ae7f4cbb053512.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65a1f4a490fcb8835c097696-1773420413370.png"},"lvl":11,"status":"offline","id":"65a1f4a490fcb8835c097696","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/884b09d9546137653394d199386844f50d89116b81dc8190f0ae7f4cbb053512.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65a1f4a490fcb8835c097696-1773420413370.png"}},"verified":false,"discord":"htt